根据提供的网络搜索结果，有几个不同的方法可用于通过Gravityforms更改用户在用户注册时的角色。[[3](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/48551311/change-wordpress-user-role-on-gravityforms-submission)][[7](https://legacy.forums.gravityhelp.com/topic/assign-roles-with-user-registration)][[8](https://wp-qa.com/change-wordpress-user-role-on-gravityforms-submission)][[10](https://www.role-editor.com/forums/topic/gravity-forms-user-registration/)]

在这些方法中，Gravity Forms插件的"用户注册"附加组件是必需的[[4](https://www.gravityforms.com/add-ons/user-registration/)]。您可以使用Gravity Forms创建一个带有用户注册字段的表格[[4](https://www.gravityforms.com/add-ons/user-registration/)]。一旦用户填写并提交表格，它会创建一个WordPress用户帐户[[4](https://www.gravityforms.com/add-ons/user-registration/)]。

有两个方法可以更改用户角色，其中一个包括使用Gravity Forms的用户注册附加组件[[3](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/48551311/change-wordpress-user-role-on-gravityforms-submission)][[7](https://legacy.forums.gravityhelp.com/topic/assign-roles-with-user-registration)][[10](https://www.role-editor.com/forums/topic/gravity-forms-user-registration/)]。在这种情况下，您可以在创建Gravity Forms表格时为该表格创建一个用户注册Feed [[3](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/48551311/change-wordpress-user-role-on-gravityforms-submission)][[7](https://legacy.forums.gravityhelp.com/topic/assign-roles-with-user-registration)][[9](https://www.gravityforms.com/blog/this-months-featured-add-on-user-registration/)]。通过添加一个用户角色字段，您可以配置此Feed以指定所需的用户角色[[3](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/48551311/change-wordpress-user-role-on-gravityforms-submission)][[7](https://legacy.forums.gravityhelp.com/topic/assign-roles-with-user-registration)][[9](https://www.gravityforms.com/blog/this-months-featured-add-on-user-registration/)]。

另一种方法是使用开发人员编写的代码。使用GravityForms短代码"gravityform action=user key=display_name"，您可以检索有关用户对像和元数据的信息[[1](https://docs.gravityforms.com/userregistration-change-log/)][[3](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/48551311/change-wordpress-user-role-on-gravityforms-submission)]。如果您想在用户提交表单时更改角色或为用户选择字段进行更改，则可以使用类似于以下示例的代码：如果将用户角色更改为“editor”，则可以使用以下代码：

add_action( 'gform_user_registered', 'change_user_role_on_registration', 10, 4 );
function change_user_role_on_registration( $user_id, $feed, $entry, $user_pass ) {
    if ($entry["4"] == "editor"){
        $user = new WP_User($user_id);
        $user->add_role('editor');
    }
}

在此示例中，我们正在监视用户注册并在此事件发生时运行名为"change_user_role_on_registration"的功能。该功能检查提交表单是否包含文本字段以更新角色。 如果表单包含名为"4"的字段并且该字段的值为"editor"，则用户帐户将与"editor"角色关联[[3](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/48551311/change-wordpress-user-role-on-gravityforms-submission)]。

无论使用哪种方法，您都可以在提交Gravity Forms表格时更改用户角色[[5](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/34823057/wordpress-user-roles-gravity-form-user-registration-conditionally-add-role)][[8](https://wp-qa.com/change-wordpress-user-role-on-gravityforms-submission)][[10](https://www.role-editor.com/forums/topic/gravity-forms-user-registration/)]。

